<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="empty"><view class="orb">☾</view><view class="section">你的个人日历，尚未开启</view><view class="subtitle">完成注册与出生档案后查看。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="home">填写出生资料</button></view><block wx:else><view class="demo">月中行运快照 · 不是精确星象事件日期</view><view class="eyebrow">关注生活的变化</view><view class="title">留意变化，也记录自己。</view><view class="row topspace"><picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{month}}" bindchange="change"><view class="section">{{month}} ⌄</view></picker><text class="link" bindtap="favorite">{{saved?'已收藏 ★':'收藏日历 ☆'}}</text></view><view class="card"><view class="section">月度与年度解析</view><view class="note">当前免费开放，按所选月份或对应年份查看报告并主动生成 AI 解读。</view><button class="primary" data-type="month" bindtap="report">月度解析</button><button class="secondary" data-type="year" bindtap="report">年度解析</button></view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" class="timeline"><view class="muted">{{item.label}}</view><view class="section">{{item.title}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.body}}</view><view class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand">{{expanded===item.id?'收起说明 −':'查看依据 +'}} </view><view wx:if="{{expanded===item.id}}" class="note">{{item.basis}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">本月的一点记录</view><view class="note">写下关注点，留给之后的自己。仅保留在本次会话，重新启动后清空。</view><textarea style="width:100%;height:190rpx;margin-top:24rpx;color:#eee" maxlength="500" value="{{note}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="这个月，我想留意……" placeholder-style="color:#7f8aa6"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="save">记入本次会话</button></view></block></view>
